    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90634" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προϋπο-τίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set under before</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπόνδυλον [θύρᾳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				36.2
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προϋποθεὶς τὸν Ἄτλαντα τοῖς βάρεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					6.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be laid as a foundation before</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεμέλιον ἢ οἷον ἔδαφος -τιθέμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τιθεμένην ἀρχήν</span> ibid.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>assume as preliminary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1325b38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1013b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>premise</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.2.11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cleom.
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mortgage before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				81.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
